<mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="700" color="#b91c1c">Device not reporting for a long time: {{deviceName}}</mj-text>
<mj-text>{{deviceName}} ({{profileName}}) has been offline long enough to be marked dead. Last seen: {{lastSeen}}.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="{{link}}">View device</mj-button>
<mj-text font-size="13px" color="#6b7280">{{link}}</mj-text>
